      "step": 1,
      "file": "flac/src/flac/decode.c",
      "function": "DecoderSession_init_decoder",
      "line": 378,
      "var": "infilename",
      "code": "init_status = FLAC__stream_decoder_init_file(decoder_session->decoder, strcmp(infilename, \"-\")? infilename : 0, write_callback, metadata_callback, error_callback, /*client_data=*/decoder_session);",
      "role": "source",
      "note": "The attacker-supplied FLAC stream is decoded from stdin (infilename \"-\" passes NULL, so init_file_internal_ binds stdin); a stdin-backed decoder gets no tell callback, so every later FLAC__stream_decoder_get_decode_position() call will fail without writing its output variable."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "file": "flac/src/libFLAC/stream_decoder.c",
      "function": "FLAC__stream_decoder_get_decode_position",
      "line": 881,
      "var": "decoder->private_->tell_callback",
      "code": "if(0 == decoder->private_->tell_callback)\n\t\treturn false;",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "For the stdin-backed decoder tell_callback is NULL, so get_decode_position returns false without initializing *position (dpos)."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "file": "flac/src/flac/decode.c",
      "function": "write_callback",
      "line": 1236,
      "var": "FLAC__stream_decoder_get_decode_position(decoder_session->decoder, &dpos)",
      "code": "FLAC__stream_decoder_get_decode_position(decoder_session->decoder, &dpos);",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "In analysis mode the return value of get_decode_position is ignored; the call fails (no tell callback for stdin / Ogg decoders) and leaves the local dpos uninitialized, violating the obligation that the output variable be initialized before use."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "file": "flac/src/flac/decode.c",
      "function": "write_callback",
      "line": 1237,
      "var": "dpos",
      "code": "frame_bytes = (dpos-decoder_session->decode_position);",
      "role": "sink",
      "note": "Uninitialized read: dpos was never written because get_decode_position failed, so frame_bytes is computed from an uninitialized value (use-of-uninitialized-value)."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "file": "flac/src/flac/decode.c",
      "function": "write_callback",
      "line": 1283,
      "var": "frame_bytes",
      "code": "flac__analyze_frame(frame, decoder_session->frame_counter-1, decoder_session->decode_position-frame_bytes, frame_bytes, decoder_session->aopts, fout);",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "The poisoned frame_bytes (and decode_position) are passed into the per-frame analysis output, where the uninitialized value is consumed and reported by MemorySanitizer."
    }
